Package: faperu.analysis
Title: Design-Based Estimation and Cross-Survey Linkage for Peruvian Official Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Richar Andre", "Vilca Solorzano", email = "andrevilcasolorzano@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-2385-5263")),
    person("Dina Maribel", "Yana-Yucra", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0003-6218-2735"))
  )
Description: Companion to 'faperu'. Design-based estimates of means,
    proportions and totals with standard errors, confidence intervals and
    the coefficient-of-variation quality bands used by INEI; ready
    indicators checked against published INEI figures; linkage of
    estimates from several surveys by district code and year; maps and
    tables for papers. Independent package, not affiliated with INEI.
